<para id="RM00000061000RX" category="J" type-id="30331" name-id="442OY-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Skid Control Buzzer (VSC Buzzer) Does Not Sound</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000061000RX_04" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TR00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C162971J01" width="7.106578999in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000061000RX_05" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000061000RX_06" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0015" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TS00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (ECU-IG No.1 10A)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the fuse (ECU-IG No.1 10A).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.11in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.13in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ECU-IG No.1 Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0016" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0021" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0016" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TT00000">
<scantool type="8"/>
<testtitle>Perform Active Test (VSC Buzzer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), perform the Active Test of the skid control buzzer (VSC buzzer). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
<table frame="all" pgwide="1">
<title>Active Test</title>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="col1" colwidth="1.72in"/>
<colspec colname="col2" colwidth="3.31in"/>
<colspec colname="col3" colwidth="2.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Test Details</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Restrictions</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>VSC/HB Buzzer</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Skid control buzzer ON ←→ OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Possible at SPD = 0km/h</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Buzzer sounds according to operation</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0022" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0017" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0017" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TU00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Skid Control Buzzer</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the positive (+) battery lead to terminal 2 (IG1) of the skid control buzzer and the negative (-) battery lead to terminal 1 (BZ).</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C146349J02" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Buzzer sounds</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0018" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0023" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TV00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Skid Control Buzzer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>With the IG OFF, disconnect the brake actuator assembly and skid control buzzer connectors.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of the wire harness side connectors between the brake actuator assembly and skid control buzzer.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C154584J02" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.10in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.14in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>21(BZ) - 1(BZ)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the wire harness side connector of the skid control buzzer and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.90in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC0" colwidth="1.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.16in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2 (IG1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0019" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0024" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0019" proc-id="RM0550J___00007TW00000">
<testtitle>Inspect ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly (GND1)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the brake actuator assembly wire harness side connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C154597J03" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.04in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.06in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 (GND1) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0020" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000061000RX_06_0024" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0020">
<testtitle>Replace ABS &amp; Traction Actuator Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000304V000X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0021">
<testtitle>Replace Fuse</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0022">
<testtitle>Perform Problem Reproduction Test<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0023">
<testtitle>Replace skid control buzzer</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000061000RX_06_0024">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
